name 'ai-generated-design-postassessment-q11_2025'

question 'A designer is creating a website for a local news station. They notice that most news sites place the logo at the top left, navigation links across the top, and a footer with contact details. The designer uses the same layout in their design. How does this decision help users?'

wrong 'It makes the website stand out from other news sites.'
wrong 'It adds extra features that make the site more advanced.'
wrong 'It improves the site\'s loading speed and performance.'
right 'It creates a familiar structure that helps users navigate easily.'

allow_multiple_attempts false

